From 8a76d2aa98d22a4e83bcbc3774d04cd2c3321612 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 12:51:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(marketing): redesign homepage, add About and Privacy
 pages

Redesigns the homepage messaging around problem -> curse -> business
impact -> insight/solution, and adds two pages that were missing for a
site people will actually check before signing up:

- src/pages/Homepage.tsx: restructured around what multi-payer billing
  actually costs a revenue team (hours lost manually cross-checking,
  poor cash-flow visibility, errors caught too late, claims that go
  quiet) before presenting the feature set as the fix. Kept the
  existing feature grid, how-it-works, trust strip, and CTA.
- src/pages/About.tsx: mission/story plus a core-values section
  (auditability, built for the real payer mix, exception-based
  operations, compliance by default). Written to what's actually true
  today -- built by Wellinovate Limited -- with no invented metrics,
  team bios, or funding claims.
- src/pages/Privacy.tsx: a real privacy policy (scope, data collected,
  use, sharing, security, retention, rights, contact) rather than just
  a claims badge on the homepage. Security language says "designed to
  align with HIPAA/NDPR" rather than claiming certification WelliPay
  doesn't have. Contact email (privacy@wellipay.com) is a placeholder
  -- needs to point at a real inbox before this goes live.
- src/components/SiteHeader.tsx / SiteFooter.tsx: shared nav/footer
  (About, Privacy, sign in, sign up) used by Homepage, About, and
  Privacy, so adding a page later doesn't mean re-wiring links three
  places.
- App.tsx: added /about and /privacy routes.

Verified: tsc --noEmit clean, production build succeeds, and all three
pages render correctly (screenshotted via Playwright against the built
app) with no console errors.

